  "briefing": "Meridian Combine holds Mongolia through its pump station. Reconnect 2 relays, download the records from the vault server, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Mongolia Audit: Meridian Combine runs Mongolia from its pump station, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, download the records and walk out the exit.",
